      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Do not hide the challenge, but intentionally control the narrative around it by presenting it as a minor, actively managed risk rather than a potential failure. Acknowledge the challenge transparently, but immediately pivot to the strength of your current claims and the successful defense strategy you have in place. This proactive framing demonstrates control and confidence to the board, mitigating the fear of the risk.",
      "source": "target",
